<section class="matters" id="matters" data-nav-theme="light">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="matters-text reveal" style="max-width: 680px;">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--blue);">Why this matters</p>
      <h2>Better healthcare decisions begin with better evidence.</h2>
      <p>Nigeria's healthcare system faces no shortage of ambition. What it lacks is reliable, decision-ready evidence. Too many critical decisions are still made using fragmented administrative records, outdated surveys, or assumptions borrowed from other markets.</p>
      <p>For governments, this means policies built on incomplete information. For investors, it means uncertainty. For providers, it means planning without visibility. For development partners, it means measuring impact without a reliable baseline.</p>
      <p>Consilium exists to close that evidence gap. We generate original health systems intelligence through primary research, rigorous analysis, and practical tools that help institutions make better decisions with greater confidence.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


