        <p class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--blue);">Reports & data tools</p>
        <h2>Flagship Intelligence</h2>
        <p style="font-size:15px; color:var(--body-sec); margin-top:8px; max-width:520px; line-height:1.65;">Original datasets, analytical tools, and research products that improve healthcare decision-making across Nigeria.</p>
